  "description": "ADO-PERSIST failure shapes: ten files written with exact bytes (empty; one byte; three ASCII bytes; 512 zero bytes; \"<xml\"; a UTF-8 BOM alone; \"<xml/>\"; an XML declaration alone; an empty persisted-recordset root with the schema namespaces; a nonexistent path), each opened connectionless with Recordset.Open(path, Missing, static, batch optimistic, adCmdFile): State, Fields.Count where open, then Close. Asks which malformed inputs are refused at Open, with which HRESULT and description, and which open as empty recordsets.",
